<title>NETHERLANDS: Macintosh 1996 net plunges.</title>
<headline>Macintosh 1996 net plunges.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.01 vs   3.10</p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.7  vs  22.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.00 vs   2.24</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.06 vs 999.8 million</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    16.0  vs  28.9</p>
<p>    Tax					6.2  vs   5.5</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge		 4.6  vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Retailer Macintosh NV said in December it expected roughly to break even in the second half of 1996, after first-half net profit fell to 2.3 million guilders from 10.3 million.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
